  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資安檢測實務",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL CYBERSECURITY ASSESSMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程聚焦於企業常見的資安防護措施及檢測需求，涵蓋資安管理、弱點掃描、滲透測試、社交工程演練、資安健診等主題。課程將以案例探討、深入分析的方式進行，並安排實作演練，培養學生的實務操作能力與問題解決技巧。藉由理論與實務結合，協助學生了解產業對資安檢測的實際需求，並提升與職場接軌的即戰力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on cybersecurity protection measures and assessment needs encountered in enterprises, covering topics such as cybersecurity management, vulnerability scanning, penetration testing, social engineering assessment, and cyber security evaluation. Through case studies and in-depth analysis, complemented by hands-on exercises, the course aims to cultivate students’ practical skills and problem-solving abilities. By integrating theoretical foundations with practical applications, the course helps students develop a comprehensive understanding of industry requirements for cybersecurity assessments and strengthens their readiness for professional practice.",
